    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shovel Lands</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced 2D digging platformer</strong>. <strong>Dig, dash, and fight</strong> your way through a world full of obstacles and danger. Explore and uncover the mystery behind the corrupted crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by games like Celeste, Donkey Kong Country or Ori. Dig your way through <strong>handcrafted levels</strong> and enjoy the visually striking art and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/67b67246061f96ee8fe0de3888b3ed72.poster.avif?t=1755510863\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/67b67246061f96ee8fe0de3888b3ed72.webm?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/67b67246061f96ee8fe0de3888b3ed72.mp4?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/9d1f16d167c473b2ecde95a379891777.poster.avif?t=1755510863\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/9d1f16d167c473b2ecde95a379891777.webm?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/9d1f16d167c473b2ecde95a379891777.mp4?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic digging mechanics:</strong> Dig and dash through diverse terrain. Interact with the environment and turn hazards to your advantage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/b8d78f9e24d42c6b4db2d327e6c43a5b.poster.avif?t=1755510863\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/b8d78f9e24d42c6b4db2d327e6c43a5b.webm?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/b8d78f9e24d42c6b4db2d327e6c43a5b.mp4?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, precise controls:</strong> Easy to learn, hard to master. Your dash combines combat, terrain interaction and movement into a single action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your shovel:</strong> Unleash new abilities and take your gameplay to the next level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/1ba2976573e28b5feaf23ff8a4786740.poster.avif?t=1755510863\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/1ba2976573e28b5feaf23ff8a4786740.webm?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/1ba2976573e28b5feaf23ff8a4786740.mp4?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique biomes and mines</strong> with individual mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter numerous traps, enemies and bosses</strong> on your descent into the depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/93e3a0f2f1c6fbe7bc587cc16c084bcb.poster.avif?t=1755510863\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/93e3a0f2f1c6fbe7bc587cc16c084bcb.webm?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/93e3a0f2f1c6fbe7bc587cc16c084bcb.mp4?t=1755510863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue allies</strong> and discover their stories. Build a community together with them</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutally tough hardcore versions of levels</strong> for an extra thrill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable speedrun challenges</strong> for the fastest diggers out there</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/0da78b442776aaa573ee17ce8514ad78.avif?t=1755510863\" width=1493 height=385 /></span></p>",
